WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Try not to picture a white bear.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Now notice what your mind has to check to obey.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In 1987, scientists made this instruction into an experiment.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A later review found rebound after suppression—but not in every circumstance.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That says something about attention. It does not prove a meditation recording works.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources. Try a free practice. Decide what evidence you need before paying.
